## A test that loads the model

A test that loads the model and scores a benchmark, as the engine's own
accuracy tests do (the classes on `LlmapiAccuracyTestHarness`), states its
own time limit, as those of them that carry `pytest.mark.timeout` do: a
case that states none is cut at the short limit a case gets by default.
